X: 1
T: A Hymn of Glory Let Us Sing
T: (also known as Sing We Triumphant Hymns of Praise)
C: Words: The Venerable Bede, 735. Translation composite of Elizabeth Rundle Charles, 1858 and Benjamin Webb, 1854. 
C: Music: 'Lasst Uns Erfreuen' from Geistliche Kirchengesäng, Köln, 1623. Setting: Ralph Vaughan Williams, 1906.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2026 Revision.
S: Music source: 'Lutheran Worship' Hymnal, 1982 Hymn 436.
S: Lyrics source: Composite from "A Collection of Hymns: Supplementary to the Psalms and Hymns of Dr. Watts", 1859 hymn 85 and "The English Hymnal", 1906 hymn 146
